<title>FINLAND: Finnish Dec export prices fall 5.1 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Finnish Dec export prices fall 5.1 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish markka-denominated export prices fell 0.9 percent in December on November and they fell 5.1 percent year-on-year, Statistics Finland (SF) said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>			Dec 1996	  Nov 1996	Dec 1995</p>
<p> Mth/mth	    -0.9 pct	  -0.2 pct	+0.3 pct</p>
<p> Yr/yr		-5.1 pct	  -4.0 pct	+9.5 pct</p>
<p>(Import prices:)</p>
<p>			 Dec 1996	    Nov 1996     Dec 1995</p>
<p> Mth/mth	     +/-0 pct	    -1.2 pct     +0.1 pct</p>
<p> Yr/yr		 +2.2 pct	    +2.3 pct     -0.5 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358 - 9 - 680 50 245</p>
</text>
